<title>GERMANY: DMG raises Lufthansa 1997, 98 EPS outlook.</title>
<headline>DMG raises Lufthansa 1997, 98 EPS outlook.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday it raised its DVFA earnings per share estimates on German airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG for 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>DMG said its 1997 outlook for Lufthansa was raised to 1.90 marks per share compared with the prior forecast of 1.68 marks.</p>
<p>For 1998, DMG raised its estimate to 2.27 marks per share from 1.87 marks.</p>
<p>DMG earlier said it recommended that investors switch into Lufthansa from British Airways.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
